      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your search for meaning in an empty universe is a shared human struggle where logic sometimes clashes with deeper purpose. True resilience isn't found in emptying the world of meaning, but in choosing to create small moments of warmth and care for others when alone. Even in the cold vastness, every act of kindness you perform today proves that love and growth are real forces we can claim and hold.",
