      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your exhaustion comes from forcing grand meaning without support, so it feels like a useless performance you hate. Sometimes stopping to rest without trying to fix everything is enough; you don't need cosmic drama to have a single day matter. Let today just be another day survived, not something you have to make heroic, and leave the rest of the heavy lifting to when you feel ready.",
